abstract: >-
  Quantum Spectrodynamics (QSD) derives Standard Model parameters
  from the geometry of the [[5,1,3]] perfect quantum error-correcting
  code. From the holographic bit density, golden ratio, graph strain,
  and Planck mass, it produces with zero free parameters: the fine
  structure constant (15 ppm), weak mixing angle (0.5%), Higgs mass
  (1.3%), and a falsifiable 28 GeV syndrome prediction (0.2% from
  CMS dimuon excess).
